# Render Static Site Redirect Rules
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
# react-snap pre-renders each public route into dist/<route>.html
# _redirects rewrites clean URLs to the .html files.
# Render serves .html files natively with Content-Type: text/html.
#
# DO NOT use flat extensionless files (dist/terms, etc.)
# If they exist, Render ignores _redirects and serves them as binary/octet-stream.
# That causes browser downloads. We removed them in postbuild.
#
# SPA private routes continue to use the /* /index.html 200 catch-all fallback.

/terms /terms.html 200
/privacy-policy /privacy-policy.html 200
/refund-policy /refund-policy.html 200
/features /features.html 200
/pricing /pricing.html 200
/security /security.html 200
/contact-sales /contact-sales.html 200
/blog /blog.html 200
/* /index.html 200